036245,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDM2MjQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13036245?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang","html_url":"https://github.com/runbozhuang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-16T04:41:32Z","updated_at":"2025-04-16T04:41:48Z","body":"> I’ve checked the last 20 log files, but I couldn’t find any error messages or anything unusual.\n> \n> At least 2 of those 20 sessions should have experienced a crash, so I would have expected something to show up.\n> \n> Is there anything else I can do to help investigate this?\n\n@aoisensi \n1.Open Command Prompt: Press Win + R, type cmd, and hit Enter.​\n2.Navigate to Godot's Directory: Use the cd command to change to the directory where your Godot executable is located. For example:​ cd C:\\path\\to\\godot\n3. Run Godot with the --verbose Flag: Execute the following command:​\ngodot --verbose\n\nIt will have an extra console opening, and when crash happens, the console will have some information when crash happen again(If I am not mistaken) ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2808274193/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart